  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "game-description-d4635683-4b5a-4d8e-850f-93109857e890-0",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Fortnite brings several forms of online play into a shared visual and technical world. Save the World combines cooperative combat with building defenses, while Battle Royale places players in a shrinking arena where survival, equipment, positioning, and, in its building modes, construction shape each encounter."
    },
    {
      "id": "game-description-d4635683-4b5a-4d8e-850f-93109857e890-1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Its later creative tools expanded Fortnite into a platform for player-made spaces and experiences. The release dates here distinguish the original 2017 cooperative early-access launch from the separate arrival of Battle Royale, rather than assigning every part of Fortnite a single launch date."
    },
